{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_10_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:acd9bdebd0b67d2ca39a3ffe0b4d38a41f02323688a0578b452d159916f2f27a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c4156df217bc712d5585d2007d50545ee7c29bb35c69cf8decad22ab7b49977",
      "text": "各位的脸庞，\n直到最后排都看得很清楚哦。谢谢你们的应援。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6991a76e24302d65871bb6581686b2b589905f48f18b008ca649bfbbbfbcde45",
      "text": "……话虽如此，还真是耀眼啊。\n被灯光映照出的观众的表情，以及心灵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2082d0622cf22dfa57140350d2c6574e00ec6adbc375dfdc41c930d1546bd9e7",
      "text": "是啊……如此打动人心的光景，\n竟然存在于陆地上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67668d55132a517225d26cab7a4834f715e5e65ebce33376942b9185f10482d5",
      "text": "粉丝福利，是对自己呢，还是对周围呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208d9eda08b1de2a0cf61edacb2beb3919092ee310dd3be7df6e19ab4b63a13c",
      "text": "呵呵，我在向你们挥手哦—。\n谢谢你们的应援，我好好注意到了哦—。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:358f05e662bd73bde14b7e2672b27f684a72b2696928a3301cb7409da18f4c8d",
      "text": "好了，克里斯和雨彦也别光顾着感动了—。\n要把我们Legenders帅气的身姿展现给大家看喽—？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60d7258d6e0f1d8da28c2a59d45fe1098373884e4f2e2403a541aaa6f2c9271",
      "text": "确实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945f695d1c91f59146e993a7c1602364d8aa834db50b285779de5b74bdd3eada",
      "text": "噢噢！喂快看，玄武。是转播的摄像机！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca12304c220937cd3f9fec718b60f2ffc08e73a2ac4644e9e3e51f6e20896aed",
      "text": "嚯。那就在这里\n让大家见识一下神速一魂的狠劲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95aff09790a1aa29090f95507c1261f113ecb42429647793227a6c539dad33f0",
      "text": "噢噢噢！\n在摄像机那头看着的，全世界的恶徒们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19387a6587171a11f453e98137b9d5b9c416df0621e545203caa343e5bdcb007",
      "text": "只要有我神速一魂在，任何恶行都休想逃过我们的眼睛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edc28a8304dfca515ca6eed601bb974219c35068f6869816da4ff35425ceb1fa",
      "text": "作恶的家伙，我们会好好收拾你们的！\n想要改过自新就趁现在……哈！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b3bb5acb2251f2c191469a0a4e3158cba51866d51482b1aa28a674ef556e42b",
      "text": "（糟、糟糕，跟观众席的女孩子对上视线了！\n得、得、得做点什么粉丝福利才行……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb6627a3583438ca57e2e59d2d3d1dc32ca7b8b06a903490590c1ee9d1c9dca",
      "text": "喵—！喵喵喵，喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1480a1e40914bcd06cdf055035b9c216f71a59e7c718cc7a8227236db2e797c2",
      "text": "替、替我解围……谢谢你啊，喵子！\n你也是最棒的伙伴！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
